-- title:
--   Explicit inverse of the real Gaussian Toeplitz block
-- statement:
--   Let $\alpha, \sigma, b \in \mathbb R$ with $\alpha^2 \sigma > 0$ and $T = $ `realToep α σ b n` the real Gaussian Toeplitz block. With $q = e^{-2\pi\alpha^2\sigma}$ and the coefficient sequences $a^{\pm}$,
--
--   $$T^{-1} = \Gamma_q^{-1}\, U(a^{+})\, \Gamma_q\, L(a^{-})\, \Gamma_q^{-1}.$$
--
--   In Lean:
